#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:1 2c90fcda262a49098f7774450abfcd5b
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:3 a024985e19414db18ea914a1722755d3
msgid "Frequently asked questions and common troubleshooting solutions."
msgstr "常见问题与故障排除方案。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:5 31a1b3b449db49f3869996e00f8a44fc
msgid "Installation Issues"
msgstr "安装问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:7 5f0f972dd9454cf98d5127f871ca43cf
msgid ""
"Q: `apt` cannot find `python3-colcon-common-extensions` / `python3-rosdep` /"
" `python3-vcstool`"
msgstr ""
"问：`apt` 找不到 `python3-colcon-common-extensions` / `python3-rosdep` / "
"`python3-vcstool`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:9 a28d52aa1c3542aea9c241979bd9e90d
msgid ""
"Those packages are in the ROS 2 apt index, not stock Ubuntu. On a bare 24.04"
" host or container, add the ROS key + Noble ROS 2 source, then `apt update`,"
" **before** installing them. Full order: [Install "
"Environment](2-install_environment.md). fishros is an optional shortcut, not"
" the only path."
msgstr ""
"这些包在 ROS 2 apt 索引里，不在原版 Ubuntu。在裸 24.04 主机或容器上，先添加 ROS 密钥 + Noble 的 ROS 2 "
"源，再 `apt update`，**然后**才安装它们。完整顺序：[环境安装](2-install_environment.md)。fishros "
"是可选捷径，不是唯一路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:11 09b717d2a8ea41e084d1c34830e9211a
msgid "Q: rosdep init fails with \"already initialized\""
msgstr "问： rosdep init fails with \\\"already initialized\\\""

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:13 dbda29c7c99048faa641b79df4bcb23b
msgid "This is normal if you've used ROS 2 before. Just run update:"
msgstr "如果以前使用过 ROS 2，这是正常现象。直接执行更新即可："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:15 3bdefb85b83b450490070b030b0faf14
msgid "rosdep update\n"
msgstr "rosdep update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:19 a617beed91d94d09860639636ca27ec0
msgid "Q: Package not found after apt install"
msgstr "问：apt install 后找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:21 c290eab52b8e484e85475e186bbecc01
msgid ""
"This applies to packages that **are** in the ROS apt index (for example "
"`ros-jazzy-desktop`) after the ROS 2 apt source exists. After ROS is "
"installed, clone a deploy workspace and run `./init_repo.sh`, then `source "
"install/setup.bash` after `colcon build`."
msgstr ""
"这适用于 ROS 2 apt 源已存在之后、**确实**在 ROS apt 索引中的软件包（例如 `ros-jazzy-desktop`）。装好 ROS"
" 后，克隆部署工作区并运行 `./init_repo.sh`，`colcon build` 之后 `source "
"install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:23 9f66848f82064dca8b82fa27de7144c7
msgid "sudo apt update\n"
msgstr "sudo apt update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:27 bad67b542f11482e8b85af0489b3d1f9
msgid "Q: OCS2 `.deb` not found via apt"
msgstr "问：用 apt 找不到 OCS2 `.deb`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:29 7ae70d1f41634a62acab8683f4d7246c
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt software sources. `sudo apt "
"install ros-jazzy-ocs2` will not find it."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt 软件源。`sudo apt install ros-jazzy-ocs2` "
"找不到该包。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:31 3446e35debd74afd99597bd616a8ec27
msgid ""
"**Primary path:** in `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, run "
"`./init_repo.sh`. Choose `d` for OCS2 (menu 1), switch source ↔ deb with "
"menu **2**, or install/update with menu **3** "
"(`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`)."
msgstr ""
"**主路径：** 在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中运行 `./init_repo.sh`。给 OCS2 选 "
"`d`（菜单 1），用菜单 **2** 在源码 ↔ deb 之间切换，或用菜单 **3** "
"安装/更新（`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:33 d49639d6f1cd41869cf51c4ddf952c17
msgid "To build from source, choose `s` during init (or menu 2)."
msgstr "要从源码构建，在 init（或菜单 2）时选 `s`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:35 488f7cfc8a3f487c9acbe33b56feca9b
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:38 ba397050964a41458dde274ce395b883
msgid ""
"Download the matching asset from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) and `sudo dpkg -i "
"ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb` only if you are not using a deploy workspace."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时，才从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配资源并执行 `sudo "
"dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:41 18491c0f8a5c4bfd89704680599e5e91
msgid "Submodule Issues"
msgstr "子模块问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:43 6b6ab147283248d4bd16c72a9da8a15f
msgid "Q: Submodules are empty after clone"
msgstr "问：克隆后子模块为空"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:45 442aed60bb494436941a9782d022c07c
msgid ""
"In `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, re-run `./init_repo.sh` (menu 1). In "
"FaSim-Isaac / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2, re-run that repo’s `./init.sh`"
" (or `./init.sh all`). Do not start with a recursive `git submodule update "
"--init --recursive`."
msgstr ""
"在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中再跑 `./init_repo.sh`（菜单 1）。在 FaSim-Isaac"
" / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2 中再跑该仓库的 `./init.sh`（或 `./init.sh "
"all`）。不要从递归的 `git submodule update --init --recursive` 开始。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:47 5293bd9629074602a9556b84756221eb
msgid "Q: `error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`"
msgstr "问：`error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:49 494ebb961610474bb3f23c582a446994
msgid ""
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) uses `git@github.com:…`. `git config "
"url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` alone does **not** fix "
"`git submodule update` (nested repos read their own `.gitmodules` and call "
"`ssh`). After [open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/pull/8) — or once you pull an `init_repo.sh` that has `--https` — "
"the script temporarily rewrites those URLs to HTTPS. Force with `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`. Older init: clone public modules over HTTPS / `gh"
" repo clone`. Steps: [open-deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) 使用 `git@github.com:…`。仅设置 `git config "
"url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` **不能**修好 `git submodule "
"update`（嵌套仓读自己的 `.gitmodules` 并直接调 `ssh`）。[open-deploy-"
"ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) 合入后 — 或已拉到带 "
"`--https` 的 `init_repo.sh` — 脚本会临时把这些 URL 改写成 HTTPS。用 `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 强制。旧版 init：用 HTTPS / `gh repo clone` "
"克隆公开模块。步骤：[open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:51 c96cb90fe3f142edbc9a60247a1056b6
msgid "Q: How do I run `init_repo.sh` in CI / a container (no TTY)?"
msgstr "问：如何在 CI / 容器（无 TTY）里运行 `init_repo.sh`？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:53 a5c6f8ad9e6c4e9eba0e5e2afd4c31c9
msgid ""
"After [open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/pull/8) merges, or once you pull an `init_repo.sh` that has these flags:"
msgstr ""
"[open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) "
"合入后，或已拉到带这些参数的 `init_repo.sh`："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:55 c71bded629d94afba2d041f7e6f4e95b
msgid "./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
msgstr "./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:59 e86c9ef4394f44a0853669c9c398c724
msgid ""
"Same defaults as the interactive menu. Also: `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`, `-y` / `--yes`, and env `OPEN_DEPLOY_VISIBILITY`,"
" `OPEN_DEPLOY_OCS2`, `OPEN_DEPLOY_ARMS`, `OPEN_DEPLOY_COMMON`. "
"`./init_repo.sh --help` lists the rest."
msgstr ""
"默认值与交互菜单相同。另外还有：`--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`、`-y` / `--yes`，以及环境变量 "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_VISIBILITY`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_OCS2`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_ARMS`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_COMMON`。其余见"
" `./init_repo.sh --help`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:61 1c9847420c2a43049e37c839aa2975cc
msgid ""
"**Older interactive-only `init_repo.sh`:** HTTPS / `gh` public clone "
"fallback on [open-deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"**旧版仅交互的 `init_repo.sh`：** 用 [open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md) 上的 "
"HTTPS / `gh` 公开克隆回退。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:63 78b09e6d38c24b2fbfa4471cf70b1685
msgid "Q: Access denied to submodule"
msgstr "问：子模块访问被拒绝"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:65 604057c4013140f1b6891a003d36a961
msgid ""
"This usually means you're trying to access a private submodule without "
"proper access, or the remote is still SSH and this machine has no key."
msgstr "这通常表示正在访问没有权限的私有子模块，或远程仍是 SSH 而本机没有密钥。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:67 e0bb0f4fbf7c463da2c8a1ca0fcdc097
msgid ""
"**For open-deploy-ws:** Only public submodules should be needed. Check that:"
msgstr "**对于 open-deploy-ws：** 只需公开子模块。请确认："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:68 9d9669a24a22439886548cf6e50d3633
msgid "You're on the correct branch"
msgstr "当前位于正确的分支"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:69 1fb62d268eb64dee821e96d87ac76d1f
msgid "The submodule is listed as public in `submodules_visibility.conf`"
msgstr "该子模块在 `submodules_visibility.conf` 中列为公开"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:70 c37aa8c3c09141d1bf0d52b1986d9bba
msgid "You have `ssh` + a key, or you used the HTTPS / `gh` workaround"
msgstr "已有 `ssh` + 密钥，或已使用 HTTPS / `gh` 变通"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:72 8ce25cba36b34c10addbf843c24c41ed
msgid ""
"**For fa-deploy-ws:** Verify your GitHub SSH key has access to private "
"repos:"
msgstr "**对于 fa-deploy-ws：** 确认你的 GitHub SSH 密钥有权访问私有仓库："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:74 79fab09aa5704d538597806c90537b50
msgid "ssh -T git@github.com\n"
msgstr "ssh -T git@github.com\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:78 0fe7455e5f7d432b9dfdfd93b6c086a7
msgid "Q: Submodule conflicts during update"
msgstr "问：更新时出现子模块冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:80 2c9796d943c74895908e435df5d55e49
msgid ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"
msgstr ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:85 d3185baa1be2478a8e786d8361440897
msgid "Build Issues"
msgstr "编译问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:87 390068cfac6b4d5ab76a62eeece944be
msgid "Q: colcon fails on an empty directory under `arms_ros2_control`"
msgstr "问：colcon 在 `arms_ros2_control` 下的空目录失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:89 cda17a57462b498b894876c998fc075e
msgid ""
"Public init leaves private nested modules empty "
"(`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`, `libraries/lina_planning`, "
"`libraries/ocs2_humanoid`, and uninitialized `hardwares/*`). After [open-"
"deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) — or "
"once you pull that `init_repo.sh` — public mode writes `COLCON_IGNORE` on "
"those empty dirs. **Older init:** `touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`. "
"Details: [open-deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"public "
"初始化会把私有嵌套模块留空（`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`、`libraries/lina_planning`、`libraries/ocs2_humanoid`，以及未初始化的"
" `hardwares/*`）。[open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/pull/8) 合入后 — 或已拉到该 `init_repo.sh` — public 模式会给这些空目录写入 "
"`COLCON_IGNORE`。**旧版 init：** `touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`。细节：[open-"
"deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:91 661b52e119364e6bbab8bc19494d91be
msgid "Q: Where is Taku?"
msgstr "问：Taku 在哪里？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:93 c008ccdeb6c84116a13faee6aa6def82
msgid ""
"On `robot_descriptions` branch **`feature/agilex`** at "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` — not on the default `main` submodule pin. "
"Launch: `ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku` "
"([package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md))."
" There is no lean `open-deploy-ws` Taku branch. Checkout steps: [open-"
"deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"在 `robot_descriptions` 分支 **`feature/agilex`** 的 "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` — 不在默认钉住的 `main` 子模块上。启动：`ros2 launch "
"robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku`（[包 "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)）。没有精简的"
" `open-deploy-ws` Taku 分支。检出步骤：[open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:95 10179e234df947ea81eb21e82fa4a7b7
msgid "Q: colcon build fails with missing dependency"
msgstr "问：colcon build 因缺少依赖而失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:97 cfb8bd4b22814014b57290a4b76c5164
msgid "Install dependencies via rosdep:"
msgstr "通过 rosdep 安装依赖："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:99 9575d1d1d81d4bd5807cf935256be2fe
msgid "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"
msgstr "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:103
#: 01f2508093f14ff98474ec680fca7e29
msgid "Q: numpy version conflict"
msgstr "问：numpy 版本冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:105
#: 19679456c1fd41f9863586b7f05d9662
msgid "Some packages require numpy < 2:"
msgstr "部分软件包要求 numpy < 2："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:107
#: 520f52500bfb41bbbeffa4f093b99253
msgid "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"
msgstr "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:111
#: 09ee6b4b6cc24df69ee5c157ac81ba96
msgid "Q: CMake cannot find package"
msgstr "问：CMake 找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:113
#: 59942755ea36411ca7dd6a15add9934b
msgid ""
"Build from a workspace that already ran `./init_repo.sh`. If `ros2` / "
"`colcon` is missing, finish [Install Environment](2-install_environment.md) "
"first. After a successful build, `source install/setup.bash` in the launch "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"在已经跑过 `./init_repo.sh` 的工作区构建。若缺少 `ros2` / `colcon`，先完成 "
"[安装环境](2-install_environment.md)。构建成功后，在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:115
#: 9ed3d078a0db472fa131fdd71433a07d
msgid "Q: Build runs out of memory"
msgstr "问：编译时内存不足"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:117
#: 26619dd560414b2ab42f1df76d4be1dc
msgid "Limit parallel jobs:"
msgstr "限制并行任务数："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:119
#: 1560d370b6644c629c3a249565dc316b
msgid "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"
msgstr "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:123
#: 82fbdccd067d4378a67074298b1fbbaf
msgid "Or build specific packages:"
msgstr "或者只编译指定软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:125
#: 2267c7b7ae2747d08048beeff9f92c1e
msgid "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"

