msgstr "机器人参数与可用描述包匹配"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:151
#: fae8f758984b4ca5809d0dab9f3b25c5
msgid "Required hardware interfaces are initialized"
msgstr "所需硬件接口已初始化"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:153
